            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/566600/extras/88c7d494b490faefe8c713913c162f6f.avif?t=1773194334\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/566600/extras_big/88c7d494b490faefe8c713913c162f6f.avif?t=1773194334 width=800 height=458 /></span>As Lorna, you have now learned of Alfred Cypress, your grandfather. You have also encountered the technology he has invented and learned of people who also may be trying to attain this. Additionally, now you have gained access to a few of the virtual training areas he has created. This area in particular for training contains a mansion that you need to navigate through, while overcoming the challenges and working to achieve the assets it holds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now having learned from studying some of the items you found while on the island and knowing that there is a need to continue to learn more. It is needed to find more information and hope to also find more that leads to your grandfather as well. As there are others who certainly want to gain this valuable information, be careful and trust no one. The virtual mansion itself also has many surprises to make your mission even more exciting—and dangerous. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful and use the resources available paying attention to everything. Regardless of what you face, you must continue to acquire what is needed to help in your quest to learn the truth, gain the assets, and then get out safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/566600/extras/1d98e792e383f2f1f6d57d80dfeb7609.avif?t=1773194334\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/566600/extras_big/1d98e792e383f2f1f6d57d80dfeb7609.avif?t=1773194334 wi